      "value": "Hello!\n\nThis Canny board is for bug reports, for user support or assistance with lost persistence data submit a user support request within 30 days of the incident with world + timestamps to https://vrch.at/support in a ticket.\n\nThe VRChat QA team or community members on this board cannot fix your account and cannot restore lost persistence data, when the user support team can.\n\nFor future posts, please ask questions on the [VRChat Ask](https://ask.vrchat.com/) forums.",
