  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "On Monday night, I turned on VRChat only for an error message to appear after loading in telling me that the anti cheat had an error and to verify the integrity of my files. I closed the game and verified my files as suggested, the game works like normal but now the consistency of my Fish save file is broken and has reset my progress to 0. Every time I close the game and open it now, it will reset to 0 again and again. How do I get my original save file back? Is there a way to restore the consistency and the save file?",
